The pot (vv. 6, 11-12): After the meat is removed, focus shifts to the pot itself: 
\f2 \uc0\u1505 \u1460 \u1497 \u1512 
\f1  
\f2 \uc0\u1488 \u1458 \u1513 \u1462 \u1473 \u1512 
